# Games home layout (do not break)

## Required: library categories banner

The Games section (`control type="group" id="17000"`) **must** keep the top `WidgetListCategories` row inside `grouplist` `17001`, matching Movies (`5001`):

- `content_path`: `plugin://plugin.program.ziro.games/?path=/library`
- `list_id`: `17290`
- Header: `Games Library`

This banner was removed twice by accident. Do not delete it when changing platform rows or visibility.

## Grouplist children: never wrap widgets in `<control type="group">`

`WidgetGroupListCommon` uses `usecontrolcoords`. Wrapping `ZiroGamesWidgetList*` / `WidgetListCategories` includes in an extra group breaks row layout and can hide the categories banner.

Pass dynamic visibility via `$PARAM[visible]` on **CategoryLabel**, **BusyListSpinner**, and the panel — not via a wrapper group.

## Platform rows only (no genre shelves on home)

Keep `ZiroGamesPlatformWidgets` in `17001`. Do **not** re-add `ZiroGamesGenreWidgets` to `Home.xml` unless explicitly requested.

## Validation

Run `python3 tools/ziro_validate_addons.py` before commit; it checks the categories banner and forbidden group wrappers.
